      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "Ask the Creative People and Industry Professionals in your life to tell you their honest opinion. You are a Big Kid and you can take it!",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Ask them if there..."
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "is quality to the Production Value?"
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "Does the writing seem fitting for the intended genre?"
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "Is the acting a good representation of the Actor’s skill set?"
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "Was their type identifiable?"
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "Was it engaging the whole way through?"
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "Was the sound quality an issue?"
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "Did they want to see more?"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "HOPEFULLY YOU WILL RECEIVE SOME BENEFICAL COMMENTS TO HELP YOU GROW AND ENCOURAGE YOUR BUDDING FILMMAKER ASPIRATIONS 🙏🏻🤗🌟",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "Critical Distance In Your Own Work",
          "href": "https://researchinsiders.blog/2019/09/12/the-critical-distance-break/",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/no-excuses/use-it/images/5FAB0836-E987-4E09-A16F-70E5A7731CCC.jpg",
          "width": 618,
          "height": 618
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "If during your own critical review of the clip and the trusted opinions of your creative people and the Industry Pros, you decide to reshoot or shoot a portion of it again, then try to make that decision as soon as you are able."
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "Even professional produductions have trouble matching sets &amp; look while starting up again"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/no-excuses/use-it/images/EFB02066-9414-4E12-9C48-3B87FF8FA6E1.jpg",
          "width": 640,
          "height": 360
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "full-width",
      "classes": [
        "full-width-section"
      ],
      "spacing": {
        "top": "normal",
        "bottom": "normal"
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/no-excuses/use-it/images/575001F0-0538-422A-9B0A-2EE4E11E63FB.jpg",
          "width": 2560,
          "height": 1920,
          "displayWidth": 1024
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "single-column",
      "classes": [
        "single-column-section",
        "large-content-spacing-top",
        "large-content-spacing-bottom"
      ],
      "spacing": {
        "top": "large",
        "bottom": "large"
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/no-excuses/use-it/images/cef74629-88bb-4dea-9d44-aebdf2e606ad.jpg",
          "width": 225,
          "height": 225
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Probably the most IMPORTANT place to showcase this clip is on their casting profile on Actors Access. Actors Access is the Talent side of the BREAKDOWNS which is a casting service that allows Talent Reps to submit their roster to available roles in TV/Film."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Actors manage their profiles and can submit to publicly made available castings on Actors Access."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "You would want to log in and navigate to Media Uploads."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "This service is currently priced at $22 per minute. So keep those clips under 60 seconds. It is not worth it to pay another $22 for just a few seconds."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Remember the attention span of Casting watching videos is very short and not usually longer than 42 seconds max."
        },
        {
          "type": "video",
          "provider": "youtube",
          "id": "5oNzfh-kYV4",
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "Labeling your video correctly is very important and often done wrong."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "We must think like a Casting Director. They see a profile with videos submitted to them. Do they care what the TITLE of the project is unless it is some BLOCKBUSTER movie or HIT TV SHOW?"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "NOPE.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "What they do care about it what they are watching and why would it be relevant to them."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "So a Title displaying an Emotion and a type and genre is a good eye catching idea."
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "Frustrated Band Geek in Tween Multi-Cam Sitcom"
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "Curious Youngest Daughter in Thriller Film"
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "Hopeful Son on Witness Stand in Primetime Cop Drama"
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "Actors Access",
          "href": "http://www.actorsaccess.com",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/no-excuses/use-it/images/8EC2517A-FF49-4D63-8526-7E6DD753C06B.jpg",
          "width": 630,
          "height": 383
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "Casting Networks is accessible in many regions in the US.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "In Los Angeles it is called LA Casting."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "It is predominantly used as a Commercial Casting site although there are a fair number of TV/Film, Student Film, New Media, Music Video, Print, etc casting notices posted daily."
        },
        {
          "type": "video",
          "provider": "youtube",
          "id": "cXjbBZrB5Ow",
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "A majority of subscribers find it cost effective to pay for a “Pro” account with unlimited Media uploads. This allows you to host many clips, longer reels, video examples of special skills and more."
        },
        {
          "type": "video",
          "provider": "youtube",
          "id": "d_f71yAnYyk",
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Same rules of labeling apply to this an any Casting Profile."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "While you are not limited by cost per minute, you should still edit your selections to time. Casting Directors have limited time to view materials in their daily tasks."
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "Casting Networks",
          "href": "http://Www.castingnetworks.com",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "Casting Directors Advice On Demo Reels",
          "href": "https://www.backstage.com/magazine/article/casting-director-advice-demo-reels-68721/",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/no-excuses/use-it/images/B14096B7-4725-4D12-AFBF-ED63EDE840E2.jpg",
          "width": 328,
          "height": 86
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Casting Frontier profiles are required by many Commercial Agencies.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "They have predominant commercial castings and a smaller mix of Short Film, New Media and other projects."
        },
        {
          "type": "video",
          "provider": "youtube",
          "id": "Ll4QfdBl48s",
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "Casting Frontier",
          "href": "http://www.castingfrontier.com",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "html": "."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/no-excuses/use-it/images/6496E064-259A-4DB0-84AD-32A422D16EDF.jpg",
          "width": 257,
          "height": 262
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Backstage is a resource site tied to a publication geared towards actors. They have free profiles and host a sizable amount of casting notices."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "This is an option to maintain and update your profile with media to be viewed when submitting for Casting opportunities."
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "How To Get Discovered On Backstage",
          "href": "https://www.backstage.com/magazine/article/how-to-get-discovered-on-backstage-in-2019-66605/",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "Backstage",
          "href": "http://www.backstage.com",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/no-excuses/use-it/images/7423BB12-80A3-42D2-8935-13A15BE10DE2.jpg",
          "width": 670,
          "height": 335
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/no-excuses/use-it/images/030A5D03-4F60-4C44-8BDD-997B600A78FF.jpg",
          "width": 320,
          "height": 320
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "IMDb is the Internet Movie Database and has been a valuable collective resource for everyone in the Entertainment Industry.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Virtually every TV product, Web Series, Film is listed on this site and searchable by Cast and Crew."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "It is an easy way to verify the legitimacy of someone in the Industry."
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "Even Talent Reps and Public Relation Firms have listings and client lists available."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "IMDbPRO is a paid subscription that allows users to have control over their listings. And gives subscribers more detailed information on people as well as Contact Information for anyone listed."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "A subscription runs about $20 a month and you may have an infinite number of photo and video uploads to showcase on your page."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Uploading Reels and Clips is a great idea here because of the frequency of its use. As well as search engine optimization it provides on google.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "video",
          "provider": "youtube",
          "id": "vjOQSMV_j9A",
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "IMDb",
          "href": "http://www.imdb.com",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "IMDBPRO",
          "href": "http://www.imdbpro.com",
          "align": "center"
        }
      ]
    },
