        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "Video Hosting",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "You should keep your video hosted at a reliable site with security options available."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "The sheer convenience of having a link to your Clips and Reels make this a must have."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/no-excuses/use-it/images/C789BE04-9E58-41FA-BBFD-B4B559D52C78.jpg",
          "width": 1200,
          "height": 1200,
          "displayWidth": 1024
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "The most famous video hosting platform is free to use.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "It has high Search Engine Visibility and is a social media platform in itself with subscriber options and monetizing capabilities."
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "They do lack in the privacy department so not a wise choice when wanting to password protect a top secret video."
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "YouTube",
          "href": "http://www.youtube.com",
          "align": "center"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "full-width",
