      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "Vimeo is also at the top of the list in video hosting options."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "It does have a lot less regulation and restrictions. It offers paid accounts for longer uploads and other features."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "It is widely used by Filmmakers because of its Privacy features and password protection."
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "I highly recommend it to everyone for that reason."
        },
        {
          "type": "video",
          "provider": "vimeo",
