      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "Personal Website",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "It is advisable to have a personal website at your child’s actor name as the domain.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "Even if you have not built a website, you should buy a domain for relatively cheap.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "If sudden success arises then that domain can be held hostage and sold back to you for a lot of money."
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "Or even worse turned into a pornography redirected web address"
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "Discounted domain names",
          "href": "https://www.tkqlhce.com/click-9259021-13269564",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "video",
          "provider": "youtube",
          "id": "BAHZo07NGE4",
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "type": "video",
          "provider": "youtube",
          "id": "u2TIogm-lP0",
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "What To Put On Actor Website",
          "href": "https://www.backstage.com/magazine/article/actor-websites-when-its-time-to-invest-in-yours-67631/",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
