      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "Social Media",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "It is a Parent’s choice to use Social Media as a marketing tool for their young actors."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Most brands in general have a Social Media presence if only to redirect people to their main source of information."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Some use the power of Social Media to gain a following and become a paid social influencer by brands. These opportunities can be more lucrative than a Commercial Career."
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "Different Demographics use various platforms."
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "Facebook and Instagram have the largest engagement of users.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "The ability to Direct Message a user is a networking tool many actors use to connect to Industry Professionals. You can send a note with a link to video and materials and potentially reach someone in a new way."
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "Caution: Everyone had their own ideas and boundaries to this form of communication and it is best to only Direct Message Business and not Personal accounts."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/no-excuses/use-it/images/B6E7915F-7BB1-4B95-9529-FC6E76487709.jpg",
          "width": 1328,
          "height": 747,
          "displayWidth": 1024
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Facebook is slipping in younger demographics but holds steady as the number one social network.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "Connecting a billion people together on one platform is impressive.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Using Facebook to Network can be easy to do."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "You can share links, upload &amp; share videos from your personal profile."
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "Or set up a PAGE as an entity.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "Videos can be shared by uploading to Facebook manually or by posting a video hosted link."
        },
        {
          "type": "video",
          "provider": "youtube",
          "id": "QeCcFeiR6hI",
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "Heidi Dean",
          "href": "http://www.marketing4actors.com",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "Facebook",
          "href": "http://www.facebook.com",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/no-excuses/use-it/images/56BC5BC3-E275-4656-A320-F540486A0422.jpg",
          "width": 728,
          "height": 455
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "Instagram is HUGE with the younger demographics and gaining popularity among all ages."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "It has great brand interaction and is successful for businesses of all kinds."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Social Influencers are heavily active on this platform and earn money by the amount of followers they have."
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "Actors can post limited timed video clips to engage followers on Instagram. Videos can be longer and uploaded to IGTv"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Or a link to full video cam be shared within a post or story.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "video",
          "provider": "youtube",
          "id": "KHWzla2xyqM",
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "type": "video",
          "provider": "youtube",
          "id": "fmlrY9g5QEg",
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "Instagram",
          "href": "http://www.instagram.com",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/courses/no-excuses/use-it/images/87476EDA-0BCB-447B-975A-3E471EBCF705.jpg",
          "width": 410,
          "height": 320
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "html": "Email",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Email is by far the fastest, most convenient and highly effective way to contact people and especially network.",
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "html": "All actors should have an official account to use in related communication."
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "Email has the ability to post links or embed video into message."
        },
        {
          "type": "video",
          "provider": "youtube",
          "id": "MNyyKkryKlc",
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "html": "It also has the best return rate for replies and has taken over telephone calls in the business world as preferred communication.",
          "align": "center"
        },
